      "Correlate fields across the TCP/IP stack: source.ip, destination.port, network.transport, and network.protocol, to catch protocol-on-port mismatches that single-field alerts miss.",
      "Hunt DNS abuse (T1071.004) by aggregating dns.question.name length, query-type distribution, and subdomain entropy per source.ip rather than relying on threat-intel domain blocklists alone.",
